      "writtenOn": "2022-10-07T20:01:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe a better and simpler design would be to take the items one by one from the queue, instead of the whole queue at once. I believe any performance cost of locking the mutex a couple more times will be negligible compared to the gain in simplicity and readability.",
      "revId": "293cd774c4960df66e8ea3743f9e6e7101130981",
